:: Strange Creaking Intro
The <<personsimple>> doesn't wait, beckoning you to enter as <<he>> talks. "There is this strange heavy creaking from the attic, but I have no clue what has been causing it. I worry some kind of animal might be stuck up there."
<br><br>
<<He>> turns to face you as you arrive at a ladder that looks like it hasn't been used in decades. "Here we are. Good luck." <<He>> turns to walk away, leaving you alone.
<br><br>
<<link [[Climb the Ladder (0:10)|Strange Creaking]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: Strange Creaking
<<endevent>>
<<rng 50 100>>
You climb the crumbling ladder, making sure to take careful steps to avoid the parts rotten and unstable. You arrive in a damp and dark space barely tall enough to crawl. Your eyes take a moment to adjust to the dark but... you don't see much of anything yet.
<br><br>
