:: Weird Creature Intro
The <<personsimple>> looks around nervously before leading you in <<his>> home. The place looks pretty worse for wear, even for a house on Domus Street. As you walk, <<he>> begins to speak, "Every night, I can hear knocking inside the walls... l-like this." <<He>> jitters and knocks <<his>> knuckles against the walls a couple times.
<br><br>
"E-every night. Knock, knock, knock, knock." The <<personsimple>> continues to repeat <<himself>> as if in a loop before snapping back to attention. "A-anyway, I would be grateful if you could find out the cause. Please. I'll be waiting in the kitchen."
<br><br>
The <<personsimple>> leaves you to your devices in the home.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next (0:10)|Weird Creature Home]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

