:: Hissing from Garage Intro
The <<person>> slams the door on your face. You wonder for a moment if <<he>> is actually gone before the garage door slides open. 
<br><br>
As you walk over toward the large garage, the <<personsimple>> stands with <<his>> arms crossed. "Well come on, we don't have all day. Time is money and every second I waste on you could be time better spent doing work."
<br><br>
You are led into the garage as <<he>> continues. "As you saw in my request, some dreadful little creature can be heard in my garage at night. I have never seen it but it sounds rabid. You DO have your shots right? Eh, whatever, who cares. Take care of this creature and I will reward you sufficiently."
