:: Strange Holes Intro
The <<person>> sighs and turns away, calling <<his>> butler. "Listen, I have much better things to do than deal with orphans. You will be dealing with my butler understood?" 
<br><br>
Without waiting for a response, the <<personsimple>> leaves and the butler arrives to walk you around the large manor. "So you are the contractor <<master>> hired? Some animals have been digging holes in the yard and making a mess of <<master>>'s petunias."
<br><br>
You are led to the backyard where the grass and flower beds are covered in holes, dug out from the soil and ruined. "As you can see, this is far beyond the acceptable damage. Succeed in your job and <<master>> will pay you handsomely. Until then, I will bid you farewell."
<br><br>
The butler bows before he returns into the manor.
<br><br>
<<link [[Wait for something to happen (2:00)|Strange Holes]]>><<pass 120>><</link>>

