:: Stuff Disappearing Intro
The worker steps aside to allow you to enter. As you walk down the factory floor, past the various machines processing feed and harvested plants, the worker begins to speak. "I'm sure you read, but recently valuable produce from the factory has been going missing."
<br><br>
"Workers have been hearing strange sounds and when they have went to investigate, they found the machinery broken and the metallic pieces missing." <<He>> stops at a machine which is sputtering smoke.
<br><br>
<<He>> turns to you with a grimace, "As you can see, the factory is struggling to keep up with the maintenance cost with so many incidents. Find the perpetrator and take them into custody, understood?"
<br><br>
The <<personsimple>> finishes speaking and turns to leave, glancing back one last time over <<his>> shoulder.
<br><br>
<<link [[Search the factory (1:20)|Stuff Disappearing]]>><<pass 80>><</link>>

