:: Unknown Blood Intro
The nurse checks the hallways, before gesturing for you to follow. You follow <<him>> down the hall, past various rooms you can hear groans and struggling from, and into a large room. Curtains line several open stalls, each seeming to contain a shower.
<br><br>
As you are look around the room, the nurse begins to speak with an edge to <<his>> voice. "Lately staff and patients have reported strange violent occurences they could not explain. Objects being thrown at random, victims with unexplainable injuries, blood flowing from unknown sources. All of them seem to happen in this shower room."
<br><br>
Condensation forms from your breath, the room dropping several degrees. The nurse glances nervously before continuing. "As you can tell, something strange is going on. I'm going to... return to my station. I'll check up on you later okay?"
<br><br>
And with that, the nurse rushes out of the room. You are left alone, the cold air making you shiver.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next (0:05)|Unknown Blood]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: Unknown Blood
It does not take long for the situation to escalate. The temperature drops even further, and you can hear a small whistle of wind brush your ear. The drain makes a sputtering noise as half-coagulated blood splatters out, staining the white tiles. Inspecting the blood spatter, you find it resembles elk blood.
<br><br>
You pause as you can make out a faint groaning sound, though you can't yet tell from where it originates. The drain gurgles as even more blood spills out, this time even more thick. Small pieces of raw red flesh flow up with the blood.
<br><br>
The flow steadies and slowly the floor begins to pool with blood and small pieces of meat.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next (0:05)|Unknown Blood 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: Unknown Blood 2
The sounds come to a stop as the flow slows and the remainder of the floor is covered. None of the drains seem to function, as the stagnant blood sits and begins to fill the room with a sickening odor.
<br><br>
You stand in silence for a moment, the room now completely still. The drain begins to make a thick churning sound. A log of flesh slowly forcing its way from the pipes. It comes out a meter, then two. Finally, it falls free with a sickening "plop" into the sea of blood.
<br><br>
Inspecting the tube, you can make out bones and nails within, like a body was compressed until it was unrecognizable. The shape of the log ripples and slowly begins to unravel into the form of a human, or... something resembling a human. The entity has no visible skin, just raw red bare flesh. Its face is agape, lacking in eyes, its teeth embedded and jaggedly pointing out from its jaw.
<br><br>
This being... whatever it is... speaks to you.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next (0:05)|Unknown Blood 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: Unknown Blood 3
<<endevent>>
<<generate1>><<person1>>
Despite the lack of teeth or tongue, the words flowing from the being's mouth are clear to you. "Help... me..." <<He>> rasps in a slow sad voice.
<br><br>
You face this entity and ask in calm and careful voice, "How can I help you?"
<br><br>
Hearing your voice, the <<person>>, a being formed from misshapen meat pulled together from several unrelated parts, turns toward you. The face, nothing but empty orifaces of gore sends horrified shivers down your spine. <<ggtrauma>><<trauma 12>>
<br><br>
"You... Help..." The being lifts a red finger and points to a drain, the same drain the blood and meat flowed from. Taking the hint, you grimace as you dip your fingers into the blood and pull at the grate covering the drain.
<br><br>
<<link [[Remove the drain cover (0:10)|Unknown Blood 4]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: Unknown Blood 4
<<endevent>>
<<set $payoutmultiplier to 5>>
You pry hard against the metal drain cover. It creaks slowly before popping out. The blood slowly drains down the hole and, as the lights flicker, the spirit disappears.
<br><br>
You could investigate further but for now you seem to have resolved the issue.
<br><br>
<<link [[Crawl down the drain (0:20)|Unknown Blood 5]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Report your job finished (0:05)|Unknown Blood Success]]>><<set $investigatorpayout to (100 * $payoutmultiplier)>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: Unknown Blood 5
<<set $payoutmultiplier to 6>>
Your grip the edge of the drain and slowly lower yourself inside. There is a small vertical drop before the drain pipe splits into a T shaped intersection. You wince as you lower yourself, your clothing getting soaked in residual blood as you continue to crawl further down the pipe.
<br><br>
The pipe feels tighter as you crawl futher, feeling more and more claustrophobic. The metal presses against your frame, and it feels like the pipe is crushing your body the further you crawl.
<br><br>
Eventually, you catch a glimpse of light as you emerge from the pipe into a small poorly lit room. You must be somewhere under the hospital. You glance around the room and can see various drugs on shelves. It must be some kind of storage closet.
<br><br>
<<link [[Leave the Room (0:05)|Unknown Blood 6]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: Unknown Blood 6
Peeking out of the room, you see nobody around. You sneak out of the room and silently close the door. This part of the hospital is very different from the ground floor. It looks similar at a glance, but it is noticably degraded in comparison.
<br><br>
Looking inside the rooms, you can see patients in various broken states, some missing limbs, some with open wounds, and others completely covered and out of view.
<br><br>
It seems this is what the spirit had wanted to show you. <span class="red">It would be good to get out of here while you have the chance, then come back later.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Sneak back to the front (0:10)|Unknown Blood Success]]>><<set $harperbasement to 1>><<set $investigatorpayout to (100 * $payoutmultiplier)>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: Unknown Blood Success
<<loadNPC 0 "Nightingale">><<person1>>
As you return to the reception of the hospital, your shoes stained with blood, the nurses turn to you with surprise.
<br><br>
"Well? Did you do it?" The first nurse steps toward you, <<his>> voice hopeful.
<br><br>
You let the nurses know you have resolved the issue for now, but if anything like this happens again, they should request help once more.
<br><br>
"Oh that is simply wonderful! Here, take this from all of us for your help."
<br><br>
You were paid <<moneyGain $investigatorpayout>> and return to the street.
<br><br>
