    <<saveNPC 0 "krampus">>
<<else>>
	<<loadNPC 0 "krampus">>
<</if>>
<<set $payoutmultiplier to 10>>
Disregarding your own safety, you follow the trail into the forest. The trail leads deep, deeper than you've ever gone before. Finally, the trail ends at the entrance of a large den leading under the earth.
<br><br>
You grip the edge of the den and crouch as you slowly make your way into the tunnel clawed into damp and cool dirt. A light emits from the deepest depths of the den, reaching your eyes from afar and illuminating the end of the tunnel.
<br><br>
As you reach the end of the tunnel, the space widens into something almost like a cavern. At the center stands a tall hunched figure. Its body is covered in black fur, large twisting horns adorning its head. Cloven hooved feet back down the earth where it has stepped, its pointed sharp claws perfect for tearing, the face twisted in a grimace with jagged snaggle-teeth exposed. On its back is a basket that twitches and shakes like something is inside.
<br><br>
As it lays its glowing yellow eyes upon you, it lays the huge basket to the floor and turns to you, the chains dragging from the creature's wrists. It lets out a cold deep chortle as it descends upon you.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Missing Children Krampus]]>><<set $investigatorpayout to (100 * $payoutmultiplier)>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>

