:: Something Watching at Night Intro
"You must be that new investigator I've been hearing about?" <<He>> appraises you with an approving nod.
<br><br>
"If you read through my post, I'm sure you have heard, but lately something strange has been sneaking into my home. I dare not even enter my basement most days due to the racket. If you could chase whatever it is out, I would be willing to pay what I can."
<br><br>
The <<personsimple>> steps aside and allows you in. The home is pretty small, just a kitchen, lounge, and bedroom. A small dark doorway leads to the basement.
<br><br>
<<link [[Enter the basement|Something Watching at Night]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Something Watching at Night
You step down the stairs into the dark basement, flipping on your torch, and glance around the now dimly lit room. Glass shards coat the floor. You can see a several smashed reflective surfaces as well as splintered furniture.
<br><br>
As you hold your breath, you can hear something else breathing. It sounds like it's right behind you, but nothing is there... Goosebumps spread over your arms as you creep further into the basement. A door at the end leads further in.
<br><br>
<<link [[Go through the door|Something Watching at Night 2]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Change your mind and leave|Something Watching at Night Leave]]>><</link>>

:: Something Watching at Night 2
<<set $payoutmultiplier to 4>>
You step forward and as you do, the door creaks open slightly... just a breeze surely. You place your hand on the splintered wood and push it open. 
<br><br>
The next room is cluttered and full of random garbage you are sure hasn't been touched in years. The breathing grows louder but you can't tell from where. A thick deep breathing that almost feels as if it is right down your neck.
<br><br>
A crash comes from deeper in the room and a skateboard rolls toward you. You stop it with your foot and take a step further before the door slams behind you. The noise startles you and you turn to check, but at that moment, you hear fast footsteps toward you.
<br><br>
<<set $investigatorpayout to (100 * $payoutmultiplier)>>
<<if $worn.face.type.includes("apotropaic") or $worn.over_upper.type.includes("apotropaic") or $worn.over_lower.type.includes("apotropaic") or $worn.over_head.type.includes("apotropaic") or $worn.under_lower.type.includes("apotropaic") or $worn.under_upper.type.includes("apotropaic")>>
