As the creature attempts to grab you, a rancid odor fills the room as its flesh begins to boil. It lets out a rancid pained scream as it falls backward, its flesh bubbling as if it were melting. 
<br><br>
The creature slowly fades from reality, as if it never existed at all.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Something Watching at Night 3]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>

