:: Ravaged Farm Intro
You are let into the farmhouse. It looks fairly nice despite the state of the farm itself. The <<person>> offers you a cup of coffee and takes a seat across from you. <<lstress>><<stress -4>>
<br><br>
"I assume you have heard about the issue with my disappearing livestock. It is starting to have a serious effect on my profits and this deficit is going to end with me losing the farm. Listen kid, if you can do this for me, I'll make it worth your while, kay?"
<br><br>
<<link [[Search the fields|Ravaged Farm]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Ravaged Farm
You stand and make your way to the back door, heading out to the fields. A handful of sheep are grazing, though you can tell the herd is much smaller than it should be. Near the back of the farm, you find a broken fence with abnormally large footsteps left in the mud.
<br><br>
You could follow these tracks and maybe find where the missing sheep have gone. 
<br><br>
<<link [[Follow the tracks (1:30)|Ravaged Farm 2]]>><<pass 90>><<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 800>><</link>>

:: Ravaged Farm 2
You follow the tracks deep into the moor and down a slope into the bog. The heavy footprints are a lot more faint now, lost in the thick mud and water.
<br><br>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or $transformationParts.traits.sharpEyes is "default" or $transformationParts.dragon.eyes isnot "disabled">>
    With your sharper than average eyes, you are able to follow the trail, even as it fades under the murky water. The tracks continue for a while before you end up at a large gaping cave. You can hear something large inside.
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Enter the cave (0:05)|Ravaged Farm 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
    <br>
    <<link [[Return to the farm (1:00)|Ravaged Farm Fail]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<<else>>
    Unfortunately you can no longer follow this path. <span class="blue">If only you had better eyes.</span>
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Return to the farm (1:00)|Ravaged Farm Fail]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Ravaged Farm 3
<<set $payoutmultiplier to 5>>
You timidly step into the large damp cave, turning on your torch before taking a few cautious steps, careful not to slip. As you go deeper, it oddly becomes less damp and you are able to find your footing easier as you continue.
<br><br>
The sounds grow louder as you approach the end of the cave. A sickening crunching and smacking. You peek into the chamber and your torch illuminates a towering hairy figure. In its hands it grasps a sheep carcass, torn open and half eaten.
<br><br>
The creature stands tall on two legs, its pupils dilating as it lays them upon your form in the dark chamber. It lets out a horrifying roar as it lunges toward you. <<gstress>><<stress 10>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Raise your arms in defense|Ravaged Farm Attack]]>><<set $investigatorpayout to (100 * $payoutmultiplier)>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>

