:: Ravaged Farm 4
You wake up hours later, your head throbs in pain. The cave is now empty and all that remains are the leftover sheep parts. You gag as you stumble to your feet. <<gtrauma>><<trauma 5>>
<br><br>
You climb up out of the cave and breath in the fresh air, you almost forgot how it felt to feel the breeze on your skin after spending so long in the dark and damp cave.
<br><br>
<<link [[Return to the farm (1:00)|Ravaged Farm 5]]>><</link>>

