:: Crying Baby 3
Staggering on your feet, you finally arrive at the forest churchyard. The weight on your back lightens, as you can tell whatever is on your back is happy. You place down the bones and find a nice empty patch of soil.
<br><br>
After a moment of digging, you have a proper grave. You gently lay the bones into the hole and as you bury them, you feel the weight on your back let up more and more. 
<br><br>
As you finish digging, you find a chunk of loose bark from a tree and pound it into the dirt as a headstone. The myling seems satisfied as the weight on your back dissipates and, though still in pain, your job is complete.
<br><br>
<<set $payoutmultiplier to 5>>
<<link [[Return to the client (0:30)|Crying Baby 4]]>><<set $investigatorpayout to (100 * $payoutmultiplier)>><<pass 30>><</link>>

