<br><br>
<<He>> looks at you with disgust. "Dear god, what happened to you? You are filthy." You try to explain but <<he>> cuts you off.
<br><br>
"Yes yes, I don't need the play by play. I can tell the sound is gone which means it was a job well done I assume." <<He>> lets out an exhausted sigh
<br><br>
"Thank the lord. Here, for your troubles. I'll make sure to leave a proper review for your work."
<br><br>
You were paid <<moneyGain $investigatorpayout>> and return to the street.
