:: Crying Baby Passout
<<generate1>><<person1>>
You wake up hours later at the hospital. Surgery scars line your back and an IV leads into your arm.
<br><br>
As you try to sit up, a nurse rushes over and helps you. "Please take it easy. A hiker found you lying unconscious and seriously injured in the forest. It looked like a wolf attack from the amount of damage to your back."
<br><br>
<<He>> gently removes the IV from your arm and helps you to your feet, you stumble, likely due to anemia. The nurse continues, "You were in a severe state when you arrived, we were worried you might not make it."
<br><br>
You manage to steady yourself and thank the nurse before staggering back to the front of the hospital.
<br><br>
